# Log grep rules (inherits from ../../undefined/_RULES.un)

1. Inheritance
  - Inherit all rules from `../../undefined/_RULES.un`.

2. Entry point
  - Entry file: `_MAIN.un` in this directory.

3. Execution policy
  - Use `grep -c --fixed-strings -- "$pattern" "$path"` to count matches.
  - On non-zero exit (file missing), halt with Resolution Needed.
